 AllProductDetails;i
 ⍝ Displays complete inventory details.
 :For i :In (⍳⍴ItemName)
     ⎕←'------------------'
     ⎕←' Name of the item: ',ItemName[i]
     ⎕←''
     ⎕←' Price of the item: ',Price[i]
     ⎕←''
     ⎕←' Quantity: ',Quantity[i]
     ⎕←''
     ⎕←'Total sale of the item: ',Sold[i]
     ⎕←'-------------------'
     ⎕←''
 :EndFor
